[{"id":3177612332,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc69ZoQs","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Tested locally on many demo projects and https://github.com/Calinou/godot-reflection, it works as expected.\r\n\r\nHowever, the sky appears visibly darker in Truck Town when HDR 2D is enabled in the project settings:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a6bbb2c8-97a3-48e2-a477-c6091f9313a9\r\n\r\nThis also carries over to the running project. However, reflection probes are not affected by this issue, even if you force them to update by moving them after changing the setting:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1c73b6a9-3ad7-4532-ae2e-d4abef1ceee5\r\n\r\n(The NaN you see in the reflection probe on the sun also occurs in `master`; I'll open a separate issue. **Edit:** https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110207)\r\n\r\nEither way, this has the upside of making viewport debanding functional in Mobile if HDR 2D is also enabled.\r\n\r\nIt's worth investigating for a future PR if we should also switch over the sky and reflection probes to HDR. This would improve visual consistency with Forward+ and increase the viability of HDR output for the Mobile renderer, but this needs its own proposal.","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109971#pullrequestreview-3177612332","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109971","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109971#pullrequestreview-3177612332"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109971"}},"submitted_at":"2025-09-02T18:05:03Z","commit_id":null},{"id":3250034294,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7Bt5Z2","user":{"login":"allenwp","id":17506573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTA2NTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17506573?u=6e9313e254649f6dc55e92536596487ac10bf5a2&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp","html_url":"https://github.com/allenwp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109971#pullrequestreview-3250034294","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109971","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109971#pullrequestreview-3250034294"}